msgctxt "Languages::cp_pr_youtube_id_tooltip"
msgid "<strong>How to get a YouTube video ID from a youtube.com page URL</strong><br/>The video ID will be in the URL of the page, right after the v=.<br/>For example: <span style=\"word-break: break-word;\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=abcdefg</span>. Therefore, the ID of the video is <strong>abcdefg</strong>.<br/><strong>How to get a YouTube video ID from a youtu.be short URL</strong><br/>In this case, the URL of the video is: https://youtu.be/<strong>abcdefg</strong>. Therefore, the ID of the video is <strong>abcdefg</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>How to get a YouTube video ID from a youtube.com page URL</strong><br/>The video ID will be in the URL of the page, right after the v=.<br/>For example: <span style=\"word-break: break-word;\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=abcdefg</span>. Therefore, the ID of the video is <strong>abcdefg</strong>.<br/><strong>How to get a YouTube video ID from a youtu.be short URL</strong><br/>In this case, the URL of the video is: https://youtu.be/<strong>abcdefg</strong>. Therefore, the ID of the video is <strong>abcdefg</strong>"

